# Garden fence, northern: a split-rail fence of logs, snow on every post, a plank gate.
# The Garden's fence round its 3×3 bed, along the middle of the ring of cells; the gate is in the middle of +z.
# The bed stays empty: its flowers and trees are structures of their own, drawn per Project.
kind: garden
biome: northern
variant: 1
footprint: 5x5
door: +z
anchor: 0 0 0
key:
  * snow
  m timberDark
  M timber
  X accent
